Finality-certificate test vectors (format BLOCHFC1).

Source: a real test chain of 106 genesis validators with real hybrid
ML-DSA-65 || Falcon-1024 keystores; every block proposed and every vote signed
by the production engine (attest/propose) and applied by the production
transition. Generated by
  BLOCH_FINCERT_VECTORS=<dir> cargo test -p bloch-pos-node --bin bloch-pos finality_cert_tests
(crates/bloch-pos-node/src/engine/finality_cert_tests.rs) on 2026-10-19.

anchor.hex            trusted block id: the epoch-1 checkpoint (stands in for a WS checkpoint)
cert_e2.bin           epoch 2, set source = epoch-1 checkpoint (verifies from the anchor alone)
cert_e3.bin           epoch 3, set source = epoch-2 checkpoint (needs cert_e2 first)
cert_e4_ancestry.bin  epoch 4 ("latest"), ancestry down to ancestry_block.hex (an epoch-2 block)

Measured size (106 validators, 100% participation, every vote listed):
  cert_e2: 1,422,219 B = registry 439,840 B (106 records ~3.9 KB + compressed
  SMT proofs + absence proof) + 2 x ~491 KB of votes (106 x 4,637 B each).
  Trimmed to the minimal 2/3 vote subset (71 per link): 1,098,000 B.
  Ancestry adds 304 B per header.

Check: bloch-finality-verify --anchor $(cat anchor.hex) cert_e2.bin cert_e3.bin cert_e4_ancestry.bin
